\ tests/native/kernel-inline.4 - small colon words inlined (Iteration 646):
\ results through words that inline, nest, and do not - native and CV8 must
\ print the same; and natively the marker on what can be copied.
VARIABLE BASEV  100 BASEV !
: X@ ( off --- x )  BASEV @ + ;
: XF@ ( a b --- x )  1+ CELLS + X@ ;
: USE  5 X@ .  2 3 XF@ .  7 X@ X@ . ;
USE CR
: HASIF ( n --- m )  DUP 0< IF NEGATE THEN 1+ ;
: USE2  -4 HASIF .  4 HASIF . ;
USE2 CR
: RS ( n --- n )  >R R> 2 * ;
: USE3  21 RS . ;
USE3 CR
: TWICE ( xt --- )  DUP EXECUTE EXECUTE ;
: INC  BASEV @ 1+ BASEV ! ;
: USE4  ['] INC TWICE  BASEV @ . ;
USE4 CR
\ (651) bodies with internal jumps, inlined since 651
: CNTUP ( n --- m )  0 BEGIN 1+ 2DUP = UNTIL SWAP DROP ;
: SUMTO ( n --- s )  0 SWAP 0 ?DO I + LOOP ;
: FIRST>3 ( n --- i )  -1 SWAP 0 ?DO I 3 > IF DROP I LEAVE THEN LOOP ;
: SGN ( n --- s )  DUP 0< IF DROP -1 ELSE 0 > IF 1 ELSE 0 THEN THEN ;   \ no 0> in the bare kernel
: USE5  5 CNTUP .  10 SUMTO .  0 SUMTO .  9 FIRST>3 .  2 FIRST>3 .
  -7 SGN .  0 SGN .  7 SGN .  -3 SGN 0< IF 11 ELSE 22 THEN . ;
USE5 CR
: USE6  3 0 DO I SGN 2 SUMTO + . LOOP ;
USE6 CR
.( end) CR   \ the last line: verify's native_cmp wants it (656)
BYE
